* Summary: Overall Synchronizer MTBF:1.2e+258 years


3. Default Hard FIFO Summary
----------------------------

Glossary:

   MTBF: Mean Time Between Failures
   CDC: Clock Domain Crossing
   Synchronizer Chain: A chain of registers connected as a shift register that captures a logic value from a different clock domain
